{"id":"116003","name":"Lucid Awl","type":"Material","sub_type":"CommonMonsterDrop","rarity":4,"icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Mar-7th/StarRailRes/master/icon/item/116003.png","come_from":["Drops from imagenated creatures at Equilibrium Level 4","Omni-Synthesizer — Material Synthesis","Divergent Universe enemies","Simulated Universe enemies","Omni-Synthesizer — Material Exchange"],"category":"Enemy Drop","desc":"A Wishpower fragment from an imagenated creature. An advanced material used for enhancement.","lore":"Every story worth taking seriously shares the same theme: \"How to live the one life we're given.\"\nLife is so short that even the greatest sages are suddenly tossed into this world, forced to experience a lifetime without any preparation. That is why no one ever lives a perfect life. There are always regrets, always moments wasted.\nBut luckily, we have stories. In stories, creators and readers share a different life. In stories, the human experience is continuously extended. And in stories, we can reach immortality from within our finite cages.\n\n\"With stories, we are able to live a thousand lifetimes.\"","usedBy":{"characters":[{"id":1511,"name":"Aeon ★ Aha","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Mar-7th/StarRailRes/master/icon/character/1511.png"},{"id":1504,"name":"Ashveil","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Mar-7th/StarRailRes/master/icon/character/1504.png"},{"id":1505,"name":"Evanescia","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Mar-7th/StarRailRes/master/icon/character/1505.png"},{"id":1510,"name":"Himeko • Nova","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Mar-7th/StarRailRes/master/icon/character/1510.png"},{"id":1507,"name":"Mortenax Blade","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Mar-7th/StarRailRes/master/icon/character/1507.png"},{"id":1503,"name":"Pearl","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Mar-7th/StarRailRes/master/icon/character/1503.png"},{"id":1506,"name":"Silver Wolf LV.999","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.